  "PTBXL_ecg_records": {
    "name": "PTB-XL: Large Publicly Available Electrocardiography Dataset",
    "desc": "21799 clinical 12-lead ECG records (10s each) from 18869 patients, ages 2-89 (293 records de-identified as age >89, encoded in the ~300 range per HIPAA convention -- excluded from this range). Annotated with up to two cardiologists' SCP-ECG statements (71 distinct statements) covering diagnostic, form, and rhythm categories. Waveforms at 500Hz (records500/) and downsampled 100Hz (records100/), WFDB format. Metadata (ptbxl_database.csv) is ETL-eligible; waveform files are catalog-only.",
